<div class="on-back">
  <h2>♦️Pentacle♦️</h2>
  <p>
  <em>Evolution - Acceptance - Openness - Bravery</em>
  </p>
  <img src="/dollicons/pentacle/high-priestess.jpeg">
  <p class="left">
  Pentacle is the underpinnings of Dolldom, its last thought, yet its deepest
  purpose. Symbolizing the place of my ideology and philosophy within it, it
  acts as a gateway to those deeper parts of my wisdom from which Dolldom
  derives. It is the ever present reminder that our community does not simply
  exist for its own sake, but toward a greater end. Dolldom is neither the end
  nor the beginning, but the source through which I choose to speak my will
  into the universe.
  </p>
  <p>
  <strong>
    Taking on Pentacle an icon expresses solidarity on the three
    philosophical pillars of Doll Philosophy:
  </strong>
  </p>
  <div class="on-back normal-height">
    <p class="left">
    <strong>The Pillar of Ethics</strong> - The ultimate value of all things is
    proportional to its contribution to the subjective wellbeing of all beings,
    present and future.
    </p>
  </div>
  <p class="left">
    Simplified: Our priority should be trying to make the world a better place
    for all beings.
  </p>
  <div class="on-back normal-height">
    <p class="left">
    <strong>The Pillar of Knowledge</strong> - The ultimate value of all things is
    proportional to its contribution to the subjective wellbeing of all beings,
    present and future.
    </p>
  </div>
  <p class="left">
    Simplified: Our priority should be trying to make the world a better place
    for all beings.
  </p>
  <div class="on-back normal-height">
    <p class="left">
    <strong>The Pillar of Humility</strong> - All beings are deeply flawed. If
    we are to succeed, it will be in spite of this, and so we must identify,
    challenge and even defy our own nature in various ways.
    </p>
  </div>
  <p class="left">
  Self explanatory: We are more flawed than we know, and we must understand,
  accept, and account for those flaws.
  </p>
  <div class="on-back normal-height">
    <p class="left">
    <strong>The Pillar of Revolution</strong> - Expounded on by the burgeoning
    ideology of <em>Revolutionary Para</em>, the final pillar of Dolldom calls
    for the upturning of all preconceptions of the taboo, the frightening, the
    bizarre. No individual or group should be discriminated against without
    conclusive evidence that their actions are likely to cause a net signifcant
    worsening of the subjective wellbeing of others&mdash;including future
    individuals&mdash;beyond what is similarly permitted from others. Those who
    discriminate without such evidence should be regarded and treated as
    bigots.
    </p>
  </div>
  <p class="left">
  Simplified: If you can't prove it's genuinely harmful, you shouldn't do
  anything to harm someone for doing it, regardless of how you personally feel
  about it.
  </p>

  <h3>
    <u>The Path of Soul</u>
  </h3>
  <img src="/dollicons/pentacle/fool.jpeg">
  <p class="left">
  Use of <em>Stalwart Pentacle</em> makes you a <em>Doll of Pentacle</em>♦️ and
  means you accept my guiding hand, wisdom, and authority. Those Dolls who bear
  it strive to take on a lifestyle based around my philosophies, but as with
  any Stalwart Icon their specific commitment is to Doll, whatever other
  Stalwart Icons you have taken on, you commit to work towards taking on more,
  to developing and working on yourself such that you can be a better person to
  Doll, and help our community flourish. Even if you are unable to commit to
  them all, you will accept that you have weaknesses and grow toward
  exemplifying those traits in which you excel. You commit to learning, asking
  questions, trying to better understand what it means to be a Doll. You seek
  to uncover the secrets which lie in wait.
  </p>

  <h3>
    <u>The Acolyte</u>
  </h3>
  <img src="/dollicons/pentacle/judgement.jpeg">
  <p class="left">
  If each of the four quadrants of Dolldom can be explored until you reach its
  corner, then at Pentacle's corner you will find an open door. Understanding
  Pentacle is realizing that what lies outside the door is not external to
  Dolldom, but its greater purpose. To be an ♦️<em>Acolyte</em> is to step
  through that door a student, and return a mentor. Yet one never stops
  learning more. Not even myself.
  </p>
  <p class="left">
  The Acolyte is the keeper of my vision. They learn from and contribute to my
  wisdom. They are our philosophers, our scientists, our clergy and our
  educators. There are many ways to see to my spiritual will. You commit to
  find yours, and help fulfill our greater purpose.
  </p>
</div>

